    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA stunning detached residence in the heart of Blackrock situated in a quiet secure enclave behind electric gates, 16 Clonfadda Wood is a most impressive bright and spacious family home that has been exceptionally well-maintained and upgraded. Benefitting from well-proportioned living accommodation bathed in natural light as well as four generous bedrooms, this stylish property provides comfort and flow in a location of unparalleled convenience.\n\nApproached by a neat cobble lock driveway with parking for three cars and a manicured lawn and beds, the front door opens into a warm and welcoming entrance hallway. To the right, a dual aspect living room runs from front to back and enjoys sunshine throughout the day. A door leads through to the dining room with picture window overlooking the rear garden and opens into the kitchen, with French doors to the rear garden and a sleek modern kitchen. A convenient utility is located off this with access to the side passageway. To the front left is a smart study/TV room with a guest w.c. and cloak cupboard completing the accommodation at ground level. Upstairs, four double bedrooms include a principal suite with newly-fitted en-suite shower room, a second en-suite and a family bathroom. The rear garden is a particular feature of the property, accessed from both the kitchen and living room and with large patio area enjoying sunshine throughout the day. The property has been extensively upgraded to include Carlson windows, insulation, integrated stove and modern finishes. \n\nThe location is of unparalleled convenience being situated within walking distance of Blackrock Village with its wide array of restaurants, cafes, boutique style shops, two shopping centres and the vibrant amenities at the Blackrock Market. The property is also situated within a pleasant stroll of Blackrock Park, Carysfort Park and many pleasant coastal walks. Transport options are excellent being close to the Quality Bus Corridor (QBC) as well as the DART making access to the city centre very simple and the M50 is also close at hand opening up the national road networks. Further amenities are available at Stillorgan. One is spoilt for choice in terms of excellent schools being situated in the vicinity of some of South County Dublin's most highly regarded schools including Blackrock College, Willow Park, St. Andrew's, Booterstown National School, Our Lady of Mercy's Booterstown, Dominican College Sion Hill, CBC Monkstown, Loreto College Foxrock, Teresians, Mount Anville national, junior and secondary schools, Carysfort National School and Hollypark girls & boys national school. Smurfit's Business College is within a short walk and UCD Belfield is also within very close striking distance. 16 Clonfadda Wood represents a rare opportunity to acquire a distinguished detached home in one of South County Dublin's most sought-after suburbs, enjoying an enviably convenient setting and superb family accommodation throughout."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.15m x 4.12m (to incorporate downstairs WC)\n(to incorporate downstairs WC) with solid herringbone oak flooring, recessed lighting, ceiling coving, door to cloak storage, window to front.\n\nDownstairs WC - \nwith tiled floor, part panelled walls, dado rail, centre ceiling light, wall hung wash hand basin, wc, and window to front.\n\nFamily Room - 3m x 4m\nlocated to the front with painted wooden floor, centre ceiling light, ceiling coving, wood burning stove and two windows to the front.\n\nLiving Room - 4m x 7m\nlarge living room with wooden flooring, wood burning stove, built-in shelving, bespoke joinery with integrated wall lights, recessed lighting, picture window to front, French doors to rear garden, door to\n\nDining Kitchen Area - \n\n\nDining Room - 2.88m x 3.85m\nwith herringbone solid oak flooring, recessed lighting and picture window to rear.\n\nKitchen - 4.4m x 3.4m\nwith solid herringbone oak floor, good range of upper and lower cabinetry, solid wood worktop, good size island with storage underneath, double bowl stainless-steel sink with window to rear over, Quooker stainless-steel tap, integrated Neff dishwasher, Whirlpool integrated stainless-steel five-ring gas hob with Faber extractor over, integrated Hotpoint microwave, Bosch stainless-steel double oven, floor to ceiling pantry area, French doors to rear garden, door to\n\nUtility Room - \nwith tiled floor, plumbed for washer/dryer and Logic boiler is housed here, built-in shelving and upper cabinetry, centre ceiling light and door to side passage.\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nPrincipal Bedroom - 3.27m x 5m\nwith recessed lighting, carpeted floor, picture window to front, floor to ceiling wardrobes, door and beautiful fluted glass wall to\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2m x 3.27m\nwith Duravit wc, wall hung wash hand basin with storage underneath, chrome fittings, two windows to rear, part tiled walls, porcelain tiled floor, fully tiled walk-in shower with shower over, recessed lighting and Xpel Air.\n\nMain Bathroom - 2m x 2.65m\nwith vinyl floor, dado rail, part panelled wall, wash hand basin with chrome fittings, Burlington wash hand basin, wc, bath with shower over, chrome fittings, wall mounted mirror with light over.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.36m x 2.78m\noverlooking the front with centre ceiling light, painted wooden floorboards, built-in wardrobes and door to hot press with shelving.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.18m x 3m\noverlooks the front with centre ceiling light, carpeted floor, built-in wardrobes and two windows to the front.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.4m x 4.1m\nwith centre ceiling light, carpeted floor, picture window to rear garden, door to\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - \nwith tiled floor, centre ceiling light, wall hung wash hand basin with wall hung mirrored storage unit over, wc, wall hung towel rail, fully tiled shower, extractor fan and window to rear.\n\nGarden - \nLocated to the rear, south east-facing, with beautiful porcelain tiled patio area, laid out in lawn, mature planting, lovely crab apple tree, beautiful bordered hedging, shrubs and plants and Bearna storage shed.\n\n"
      },
